(*!
<summary>Identifies an optional domain-specific deserialization context queried during deserialization.</summary>
<description>
Marker interface without members. Passed to IConfigurationSerializable.Deserialize for the duration of a
single synchronous call to supply domain-specific reconstruction services (such as workflow element loaders or
dependency resolvers) queried via __QUERYINTERFACE.
The context is borrowed and must not be retained or stored by the deserialized object across execution cycles.
A null context (context = 0) is valid when no external services are available. Objects requiring specific
context capabilities must validate the context explicitly and raise a configuration exception when absent or
incompatible.
</description>
*)
INTERFACE IConfigurationDeserializationContext EXTENDS IObject]]></Declaration>
  </Itf>
</TcPlcObject>